          "status": "DESIGN"
        },
        "backstory": {
          "v": "Kuno leaves his towel on anything the HyperNorm residents might otherwise share. The clothespin makes the claim look legally secured. He sorts neighbours into those who respect the arrangement and those who need an explanation. The Men in Black appreciate this distinction; Hunky and Dory have suggested reserving more. A dissonant card recently asked whom the empty space was helping. Kuno has begun keeping a second corner free for someone who is late.",
          "src": "NEIGHBOUR_RITUALS_6_2026-11-07/CHARACTER_INTENT.json",
          "status": "DESIGN"
        },
        "frizzlebob": {
          "v": "FrizzleBob: The place is taken. Attendance was never part of the arrangement.",
          "src": "NEIGHBOUR_RITUALS_6_2026-11-07/CHARACTER_INTENT.json",
          "status": "DESIGN"
        }
      }
    },
    {
