            "family": "WSA_NEIGHBOUR_RITUALS_20261107"
          },
          "src": "NEIGHBOUR_RITUALS_6_2026-11-07/CHARACTER_INTENT.json",
          "status": "DESIGN"
        },
        "backstory": {
          "v": "Irma insists the umbrella is meant to bend that way. HyperNorm recognises the independent and the dependent, leaving very little room for wet weather. She used to report cards that complicated the distinction. The Men in Black liked the reports; Hunky and Dory offered a certificate of self-sufficiency. A neighbour repaired the handle without mentioning it. Irma has not thanked them, but now leaves their parcels somewhere dry.",
          "src": "NEIGHBOUR_RITUALS_6_2026-11-07/CHARACTER_INTENT.json",
          "status": "DESIGN"
        },
        "frizzlebob": {
          "v": "FrizzleBob: She needs no help. The relief is strictly precautionary.",
          "src": "NEIGHBOUR_RITUALS_6_2026-11-07/CHARACTER_INTENT.json",
          "status": "DESIGN"
        }
      }
    },
    {
