        "backstory": {
          "v": "Bodo has polished the borrowed spoon and tied a ribbon round the unresolved obligation. HyperNorm classes possessions as yours or somebody else's, so he prefers to finish the matter visibly. The Men in Black find the ceremony excessive; Hunky and Dory would like a photograph. A dissonant card suggested that the loan was simply friendly. Bodo is considering this. In the meantime he has offered to lend the spoon back.",
